SECRET_KEY=your-secret-key-here
FIREBASE_CREDENTIALS=serviceAccountKey.json
JWT_SECRET_KEY=your-jwt-secret-key-here

# ============================================
# VERCEL DEPLOYMENT INSTRUCTIONS
# ============================================
# For Vercel deployment, set these as Environment Variables
# in your Vercel project dashboard (Settings > Environment Variables):
#
# 1. SECRET_KEY: Your secret key for Flask
# 2. JWT_SECRET_KEY: Your JWT secret key (min 32 chars)
# 3. FIREBASE_CREDENTIALS: Paste the ENTIRE content of 
#    serviceAccountKey.json as a single-line JSON string
#
# To convert serviceAccountKey.json to a single line:
#   - Open the JSON file
#   - Copy all content
#   - Paste it as the value for FIREBASE_CREDENTIALS
#
# Example (DO NOT use this value, use your own):
# FIREBASE_CREDENTIALS={"type":"service_account","project_id":"your-project",...}
# ============================================